<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

<main class="minor-page faq-page">

    <div class="minor-page-container">

        <div class="minor-page-header">
            <span class="minor-page-eyebrow">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>
            <h1 class="minor-page-title">Questions, meet answers.</h1>
            <p class="minor-page-intro">Everything you need to know about Crumbelle, your orders, payments, delivery, and our bakes.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="minor-page-section faq-content-section">
            <!-- general  -->
            <div class="faq-group">

                <div class="faq-group-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">GENERAL</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">About Crumbelle</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list">

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>What is Crumbelle?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Crumbelle is an artisan bakery created around the simple idea that good baking can make everyday moments 
                                feel a little more special. We offer a selection of breads, pastries, cookies, cakes, and other treats 
                                for everyday cravings and celebrations.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>What kind of products does Crumbelle offer?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Our collection includes breads, pastries, cookies, cakes, brownies and blondies, tarts and pies, 
                                cheesecakes, biscuits, and curated gift boxes.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Are all products freshly baked?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Freshness is an important part of the Crumbelle experience. Our bakes are prepared with care and are 
                                intended to be enjoyed fresh.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- orders  -->
            <div class="faq-group">

                <div class="faq-group-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">ORDERS</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Placing an order</h2>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-list">

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>How do I place an order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Browse our shop, choose the products you'd like, add them to your cart, and proceed to checkout. Enter 
                                your delivery details, select a payment method, and place your order.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Do I need an account to place an order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Yes. You need to be logged in to add products to your cart and place an order with Crumbelle.</p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Can I change or cancel my order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>You can cancel your order for a full refund within 3 hours of purchase. After this window, changes or 
                                cancellations may not be possible as preparation begins immediately. For any adjustments, please 
                                contact us as soon as possible with your order number, and we'll let you know what can be done.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Where can I find my order number?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Your order number is shown on the order confirmation page after a successful order. Keep it handy 
                                whenever you contact us about your order.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- payment  -->
            <div class="faq-group">

                <div class="faq-group-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">PAYMENT</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Paying for your order</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list">

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>What payment methods are available?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Crumbelle currently provides the option to choose card payment, UPI, or Cash on Delivery at checkout.</p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Is Cash on Delivery available for every order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Cash on Delivery can be selected at checkout where it is available. Any restrictions or additional 
                                conditions will be communicated before your order is confirmed.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Will I receive confirmation after placing an order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Yes. After your order is successfully placed, you will be taken to an order confirmation page showing 
                                your order number, payment method, and total.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- delivery  -->
            <div class="faq-group">

                <div class="faq-group-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">DELIVERY</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Getting your order</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list">

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>How much is the delivery charge?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>The current delivery charge is ₹50 for an order containing items. The applicable delivery fee is shown 
                                clearly in your cart and checkout before you place the order.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>How long will my order take to arrive?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Delivery time can vary depending on your location, the products in your order, and the preparation 
                                schedule. Please refer to our Shipping & Delivery page for the latest delivery information.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Can I track my order?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Yes. Once our order tracking feature is available for your order, you can use your order number to check 
                                its status from the Order Tracking page.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- returns and support  -->
            <div class="faq-group">

                <div class="faq-group-heading">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">SUPPORT</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Problems with your order?</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list">

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>What if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Please contact us as soon as possible with your order number and details of the issue. Depending on the 
                                situation, we may ask for photographs or other information to help us resolve it.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>Can bakery products be returned?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>Because many bakery products are prepared specifically for consumption, returns may be subject to product 
                                type and condition. Please see our Returns & Refunds page for the applicable policy.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details class="faq-item">
                        <summary>
                            <span>How can I contact Crumbelle?</span>
                            <span class="faq-plus"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>You can reach us through our Contact page. Please include your order number when contacting us about an 
                                existing order so that we can help you more quickly.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </details>

                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

        
        <section class="minor-page-closing faq-closing">
            <span class="minor-page-closing-eyebrow">STILL HAVE A QUESTION?</span>
            <h2>Can't find what you're looking for?</h2>
            <p>We're happy to help with anything that isn't covered here. Reach out to us and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="minor-page-primary-button">
                Contact Us
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </section>

    </div>

</main>

<%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>